pdate.":["Nem siker\u00fclt a friss\u00edt\u00e9s."],"No":["Nem"],"Breadcrumb":["Breadcrumb"],"Modified":["M\u00f3dos\u00edtva"],"Enabled":["Bekapcsolva"],"Disabled":["Letiltva"],"Toggle %s":["A(z) %s be-\/kikapcsol\u00e1sa"],"Are you sure you want to permanently delete \"%s\"?":["Biztosan v\u00e9glegesen t\u00f6r\u00f6lni szeretn\u00e9d ezt: \u201e%s\u201d?"],"Duplicate":["Duplik\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Condition":["Felt\u00e9tel"],"Helps Google understand the headline, author, date, and image of your articles. Can display an enhanced result with the article title and thumbnail in Search.":["Seg\u00edt a Google-nak meg\u00e9rteni a cikkeid c\u00edm\u00e9t, szerz\u0151j\u00e9t, d\u00e1tum\u00e1t \u00e9s k\u00e9p\u00e9t. A keres\u00e9sben a cikk c\u00edm\u00e9t \u00e9s b\u00e9lyegk\u00e9p\u00e9t tartalmaz\u00f3 b\u0151v\u00edtett tal\u00e1latot jelen\u00edthet meg."],"Enhanced article appearance in Google Search and Google News":["Cikkek b\u0151v\u00edtett megjelen\u00e9se a Google Keres\u0151ben \u00e9s a Google H\u00edrekben"],"Previously displayed expandable question-and-answer pairs directly in search results. Google has removed this rich result for most sites since August 2023.":["Kor\u00e1bban k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl a keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latokban jelen\u00edtette meg a lenyithat\u00f3 k\u00e9rd\u00e9s-v\u00e1lasz p\u00e1rokat. A Google 2023 augusztusa \u00f3ta a legt\u00f6bb webhelyen megsz\u00fcntette ezt a b\u0151v\u00edtett tal\u00e1latt\u00edpust."],"No longer generates rich results for most sites":["A legt\u00f6bb webhelyen m\u00e1r nem hoz l\u00e9tre b\u0151v\u00edtett tal\u00e1latokat"],"Displays a rich card with photo, rating, cooking time, and calories directly in Google Search. Recipes can also appear in Google Images and Google Assistant.":["K\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl a Google Keres\u0151ben jelen\u00edt meg egy b\u0151v\u00edtett k\u00e1rty\u00e1t fot\u00f3val, \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9ssel, f\u0151z\u00e9si id\u0151vel \u00e9s kal\u00f3ri\u00e1kkal. A receptek a Google k\u00e9pkeres\u0151j\u00e9ben \u00e9s a Google Assistantben is megjelenhetnek."],"Rich recipe card with photo, rating, and cooking time in Search":["F\u00e9nyk\u00e9pet, \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st \u00e9s f\u0151z\u00e9si id\u0151t tartalmaz\u00f3 b\u0151v\u00edtett receptk\u00e1rtya a keres\u00e9sben"],"Enables video thumbnails, duration, and live badge in Google Search and Video tab. Helps Google discover and index your video content.":["Enged\u00e9lyezi a vide\u00f3b\u00e9lyegk\u00e9pek, az id\u0151tartam \u00e9s az \u00e9l\u0151 jelv\u00e9ny megjelen\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9t a Google keres\u0151j\u00e9ben \u00e9s a vide\u00f3k f\u00fcl\u00f6n. Seg\u00edt a Google-nek felfedezni \u00e9s indexelni a vide\u00f3tartalmat."],"Video thumbnail with duration and play button in Search results":["Vide\u00f3b\u00e9lyegk\u00e9p id\u0151tartammal \u00e9s lej\u00e1tsz\u00f3gombbal a keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latokban"],"Shows price, availability, ratings, and shipping info directly in Google Search. Essential for e-commerce sites and WooCommerce stores.":["\u00c1rat, el\u00e9rhet\u0151s\u00e9get, \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9seket \u00e9s sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si adatokat jelen\u00edt meg k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl a Google-keres\u00e9sben. N\u00e9lk\u00fcl\u00f6zhetetlen az e-kereskedelmi webhelyek \u00e9s WooCommerce-\u00e1ruh\u00e1zak sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra."],"Product snippet with price, availability, and ratings in Search":["Term\u00e9kk\u00f3dr\u00e9szlet \u00e1rral, el\u00e9rhet\u0151s\u00e9ggel \u00e9s \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9sekkel a keres\u00e9sben"],"Displays star ratings and review excerpts in search results. Can be used for book reviews, product reviews, movie reviews, and more.":["Csillagos \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9seket \u00e9s a v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek r\u00e9szleteit jelen\u00edti meg a keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latokban. Haszn\u00e1lhatod k\u00f6nyvekr\u0151l, term\u00e9kekr\u0151l, filmekr\u0151l \u00e9s m\u00e1s t\u00e9m\u00e1kr\u00f3l sz\u00f3l\u00f3 v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyekhez."],"Star rating snippet displayed below your search result":["A keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1lat alatt megjelen\u0151 csillagos \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s k\u00f3dr\u00e9szlete"],"Describe a book, its edition, contributors and offer.":["Mutasd be a k\u00f6nyvet, a kiad\u00e1s\u00e1t, a k\u00f6zrem\u0171k\u00f6d\u0151ket \u00e9s az aj\u00e1nlatot."],"Book metadata for search engines. Google Book Actions require separate participation.":["K\u00f6nyvmetaadatok a keres\u0151motorok sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra. A Google K\u00f6nyvm\u0171veletekben val\u00f3 r\u00e9szv\u00e9telhez k\u00fcl\u00f6n jelentkez\u00e9s sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges."],"Shows app rating, price, and platform info in search results. Ideal for software products, mobile apps, and SaaS tools.":["Alkalmaz\u00e1s\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st, \u00e1rat \u00e9s platformadatokat jelen\u00edt meg a keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latokban. Ide\u00e1lis szoftverterm\u00e9kekhez, mobilalkalmaz\u00e1sokhoz \u00e9s SaaS-eszk\u00f6z\u00f6kh\u00f6z."],"App info card with rating, price, and operating system in Search":["Alkalmaz\u00e1sadatokat tartalmaz\u00f3 k\u00e1rtya \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9ssel, \u00e1rral \u00e9s oper\u00e1ci\u00f3s rendszerrel a keres\u00e9sben"],"Provides your business name, address, phone, opening hours, and location to Google. Powers the Knowledge Panel and local search results for your business.":["Megadja a Google-nak a v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1sod nev\u00e9t, c\u00edm\u00e9t, telefonsz\u00e1m\u00e1t, nyitvatart\u00e1s\u00e1t \u00e9s helysz\u00edn\u00e9t. Ez teszi lehet\u0151v\u00e9 a tud\u00e1spanel \u00e9s a v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1sod helyi keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latainak megjelen\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9t."],"Knowledge Panel with address, hours, and contact info in Google":["Tud\u00e1spanel c\u00edmmel, nyitvatart\u00e1ssal \u00e9s kapcsolattart\u00e1si adatokkal a Google-ban"],"Describes the services your business offers, including provider, area served, and pricing. Helps Google understand what you do and where.":["Le\u00edrja a v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1sod \u00e1ltal k\u00edn\u00e1lt szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sokat, bele\u00e9rtve a szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3t, a szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1si ter\u00fcletet \u00e9s az \u00e1rakat. Seg\u00edt a Google-nak meg\u00e9rteni, mivel foglalkozol \u00e9s hol."],"Better visibility for service-based businesses in local search":["Nagyobb l\u00e1that\u00f3s\u00e1g a szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1salap\u00fa v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1soknak a helyi keres\u00e9sben"],"Displays job postings in the dedicated Google Jobs experience with salary, location, and employment type. Job seekers can filter and apply directly.":["\u00c1ll\u00e1shirdet\u00e9seket jelen\u00edt meg a Google Jobs k\u00fcl\u00f6n fel\u00fclet\u00e9n, fizet\u00e9ssel, helysz\u00ednnel \u00e9s foglalkoztat\u00e1si t\u00edpussal. Az \u00e1ll\u00e1skeres\u0151k k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl sz\u0171rhetnek \u00e9s jelentkezhetnek."],"Job listing card in Google Jobs with salary and apply button":["\u00c1ll\u00e1shirdet\u00e9s-k\u00e1rtya a Google Jobsban fizet\u00e9ssel \u00e9s jelentkez\u00e9si gombbal"],"Shows event date, location, ticket price, and availability in Google Search and Maps. Events can also appear in the Google Events experience.":["Esem\u00e9nyd\u00e1tumot, helysz\u00ednt, jegy\u00e1rat \u00e9s el\u00e9rhet\u0151s\u00e9get jelen\u00edt meg a Google-keres\u00e9sben \u00e9s a T\u00e9rk\u00e9pen. Az esem\u00e9nyek a Google Esem\u00e9nyek fel\u00fclet\u00e9n is megjelenhetnek."],"Event card with date, venue, and ticket info in Search and Maps":["Esem\u00e9nyk\u00e1rtya d\u00e1tummal, helysz\u00ednnel \u00e9s jegyinform\u00e1ci\u00f3kkal a keres\u00e9sben \u00e9s a T\u00e9rk\u00e9pen"],"Previously displayed course info (provider, description) in search results. Google has updated its course markup requirements since 2024.":["Kor\u00e1bban kurzusadatokat (szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3, le\u00edr\u00e1s) jelen\u00edtett meg a keres\u00e9si tal\u00e1latokban. A Google 2024 \u00f3ta friss\u00edtette a kurzusjel\u00f6l\u00e9sekre vonatkoz\u00f3 k\u00f6vetelm\u00e9nyeit."],"Limited rich result support \u2014 review Google's current requirements":["Korl\u00e1tozott t\u00e1mogat\u00e1s a b\u0151v\u00edtett tal\u00e1latokhoz \u2013 tekintsd \u00e1t a Google aktu\u00e1lis k\u00f6vetelm\u00e9nyeit"],"Write your own JSON-LD markup for any schema.org type not covered by the built-in types. Requires knowledge of structured data syntax.":["\u00cdrj saj\u00e1t JSON-LD-jel\u00f6l\u00e9st b\u00e1rmilyen schema.org-t\u00edpushoz, amely nincs a be\u00e9p\u00edtett t\u00edpusok k\u00f6z\u00f6tt. A struktur\u00e1lt adatok szintaxis\u00e1nak ismerete sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges."],"Full flexibility to implement any schema.org type":["Teljes rugalmass\u00e1g b\u00e1rmilyen schema.org-t\u00edpus megval\u00f3s\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1hoz"],"E-commerce":["E-kereskedelem"],"Business":["V\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1s"],"Events":["Esem\u00e9nyek"],"Basic info":["Alapadatok"],"Hiring organization":["Foglalkoztat\u00f3 szervezet"],"Application":["Alkalmaz\u00e1s"],"Dates":["D\u00e1tumok"],"Offers \/ Tickets":["Aj\u00e1nlatok \/ jegyek"],"Organizer":["Szervez\u0151"],"Identification":["Azonos\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Pricing":["\u00c1raz\u00e1s"],"Details":["R\u00e9szletek"],"Provider":["Szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3"],"Identity":["Identit\u00e1s"],"Contact":["Kapcsolat"],"Business details":["V\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1s r\u00e9szletei"],"Article type":["Cikkt\u00edpus"],"Headline":["C\u00edmsor"],"The headline of the article (max 110 chars)":["A cikk c\u00edme (legfeljebb 110 karakter)"],"Minimum size: 696px wide, JPG, PNG or GIF (default: post thumbnail if available)":["Minim\u00e1lis m\u00e9ret: 696 px sz\u00e9les, JPG, PNG vagy GIF (alap\u00e9rtelmezett: a bejegyz\u00e9s b\u00e9lyegk\u00e9pe, ha el\u00e9rhet\u0151)"],"e.g. YYYY-MM-DD \u2014 Live Blog Posting only":["pl. YYYY-MM-DD \u2014 csak \u00e9l\u0151 blogbejegyz\u00e9sn\u00e9l"],"e.g. HH:MM \u2014 Live Blog Posting only":["pl. HH:MM \u2014 csak \u00e9l\u0151 blogbejegyz\u00e9sn\u00e9l"],"Postal Code":["Ir\u00e1ny\u